## 4. Fix
In the TimeoutError branch: if limit < stage timeout_s, the timeout IS the plan deadline -> run.deadline_hit=True, status TIMED_OUT, error 'plan deadline reached', return (no retry). A stage hitting its own timeout_s keeps the old path (new test test_a_stage_hitting_its_own_timeout_is_not_a_plan_deadline).

